items.X_18.name=X-18 The Cave Curse
items.X_18.description=A mysterious and corrupt entity that emerges from deep caves
items.X_18.lore=X-18 is a corrupted mystery beneath the stone, a curse whispered through mines by those who stayed underground too long. It waits in unseen corners, stalks from the dark, then charges without warning.
